  "answer": "This feature has been requested before. PowerToys#19041 is the main tracking issue for customizable mouse gestures. The others, including #30856, which cites MouseInc, and #27699, were closed as duplicates of it. The request is still open, but nothing has been built. A maintainer said other work, such as macro enablement, would be prioritized above it, and a 2026 comment says there has been no progress. Add a thumbs-up or your use case to #19041 rather than opening a new ticket. Until PowerToys supports it, use a third-party tool such as StrokePlus.net, MouseInc, AutoHotkey's MouseGestureL or Kando."
